# Modern To-Do List Web Application

A clean, responsive, and lightweight **single-page To-Do List application** built entirely with pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript. 

---

## 🚀 Features

* **Interactive Controls:** Click on any task text to cross it out (mark it complete) or use the **Delete** button to remove it permanently.
* **Keyboard Friendly:** Add tasks quickly by typing and hitting the `Enter` key.
* **Responsive Design:** A modern, mobile-friendly interface with beautiful linear gradient backgrounds.
* **Zero Dependencies:** Built entirely with standard web technologies—no frameworks, libraries, or installations required.



To run the to-do list click the link below
https://workwithpriyanshubisht-dev.github.io/to_do_list/
